      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think so. This one is passed to avb_descriptor_foreach() directly as the parameter `foreach_func`. It is supposed to have the type of [AvbDescriptorForeachFunc](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:external/avb/libavb/avb_descriptor.h;l\u003d84;drc\u003d4b6a634e48353da1e119ebe0287299f7b919d778).\nEspecially the pointer `*const AvbDescriptor` cannot be converted to a valid reference before calling `avb_descriptor_validate_and_byteswap` on it.",
      "parentUuid": "67bdf301_7bd4d3f7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 104,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 105,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "f9ff91726e54d3ecd838ea481e8f371f945d5aae",
