      "writtenOn": "2023-05-24T13:48:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "libavb guarantees this[1]. But the pointer `*const AvbDescriptor` cannot be converted to `\u0026AvbDescriptor` directly even it\u0027s not null. The function `avb_descriptor_validate_and_byteswap` must to be called to validate the struct and convert all the number fields from be to host byte order. This is called in line 154 below.\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:external/avb/libavb/avb_descriptor.c;l\u003d127;drc\u003d8491a425bc47375a8bf1450689bcab30db7343bc",
